        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hayo the Fox and the Little Emporium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/ea46b53c6e8e2e6e5ac0e9dc8da76de4.avif?t=1761296455\" width=720 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The owner has gone treasure hunting, leaving Hayo the fox behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hayo successfully run the emporium alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an item related to a customer is placed nearby, you can earn extra gold and trigger various effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Ready to Open</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/7c7d745a7f08c19b518ed1132c51aae3.poster.avif?t=1761296455\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/7c7d745a7f08c19b518ed1132c51aae3.webm?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/7c7d745a7f08c19b518ed1132c51aae3.mp4?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your small 5x4 emporium (20 tiles), remove unnecessary items and arrange everything carefully so that customers and items are placed well!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open the Emporium</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/447112ba8329837070c2d2b69ac8cfb5.poster.avif?t=1761296455\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/447112ba8329837070c2d2b69ac8cfb5.webm?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/447112ba8329837070c2d2b69ac8cfb5.mp4?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the business starts, items will be displayed and customers will enter the emporium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know where they'll appear...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure they can find the items they want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Best Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/61c896d9c9c6e5450dc2860c0a0e0c83.poster.avif?t=1761296455\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/61c896d9c9c6e5450dc2860c0a0e0c83.webm?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/61c896d9c9c6e5450dc2860c0a0e0c83.mp4?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After closing, you'll meet new customers and discover new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strategic choices to create your very own unique emporium!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discovering Easter Eggs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/3728edd755649853681865e7f9283d41.poster.avif?t=1761296455\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/3728edd755649853681865e7f9283d41.webm?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/3728edd755649853681865e7f9283d41.mp4?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through synergies between cards, you can discover unexpected Easter eggs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bard’s Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/9528d32dbb66d5db802e101db2fcb19a.poster.avif?t=1761296455\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/9528d32dbb66d5db802e101db2fcb19a.webm?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/9528d32dbb66d5db802e101db2fcb19a.mp4?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also listen to wandering tales told by the bard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time to Settle Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/075e526b9228da0844c2f14751794ebf.poster.avif?t=1761296455\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/075e526b9228da0844c2f14751794ebf.webm?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/075e526b9228da0844c2f14751794ebf.mp4?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to settle accounts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check if you've achieved your profit goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If not... your emporium will go bankrupt!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/794409c598b898c9cc590b92475a4a84.poster.avif?t=1761296455\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/794409c598b898c9cc590b92475a4a84.webm?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/794409c598b898c9cc590b92475a4a84.mp4?t=1761296455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet various customers and items at Hayo’s shop!</p></li></ul>",
